This repository includes third-party material under its own terms:

- BDO Grotesk font (frontend/public/fonts/). SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  Copyright 2020 The BDO Grotesk Project Authors. See frontend/public/fonts/OFL.txt.
- NISAR-derived values and images (app/data/), computed from NISAR data
  products by NASA/JPL-Caltech and ISRO, distributed by the NASA Alaska
  Satellite Facility DAAC.
- Place names and borders on the 3D globe
  (frontend/src/components/globe/places.json) from Natural Earth
  (public domain), naturalearthdata.com.
- Rain and river-flow series (app/data/drivers.json) from Open-Meteo
  (CC BY 4.0), based on ECMWF IFS, ERA5 and GloFAS data.

Full source citations are in README.md and docs/DATA_AND_METHODS.md.

